{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217160","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1621716001:1":{"text":"ジロード……ごめんなさい。私たちのせいで、クビになってしまって……","source_cn":"吉罗德……对不起，都怪我们不小心，害得你被辞退了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2C9919C8DE6A194","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621716002:1":{"text":"あの悪徳店主は、きっと仕返しのために君をクビにしたんだ！君は悪くないよ！","source_cn":"那个大坏蛋老板，他肯定是心虚了才辞退你的！你是好人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x734C64B65A707F2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621716003:1":{"text":"もし生活費が足りないなら……僕が貯めてた小遣い、全部あげるよ！","source_cn":"要是没有兼职，生活费不够的话，我可以把零花钱都给你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D678307099F24A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621716004:1":{"text":"はは、ありがとう。でも大丈夫。もともと店主とは折り合いが悪くて、もう辞めようと思ってたんだ。","source_cn":"哈哈……谢谢，你们的好意我心领了。不过别担心，这件事对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78B2C671A084122F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621716005:1":{"text":"それより、むしろ君たちに感謝したい。協力してくれたから、決定的な証拠が取れた。","source_cn":"今天这件事，我还要谢谢你们呢。感谢你们配合我拆穿了老板...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4CBC9BF76C83673","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621716006:1":{"text":"あとはこれをまとめて提出するだけ。必ず彼の悪事を白日の下に晒してやる。","source_cn":"准备举报材料的事就交给我吧，我一定会让他得到应有的教训。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7744D801EC2ED47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621716007:1":{"text":"ところで……作戦の成功を祝って、近くで一緒にランチでもしない？祝勝会ってことで。","source_cn":"为了庆祝我们的作战计划圆满成功，中午一起去附近吃个午餐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F976351D6287FED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1621716008:1":{"text":"ぜひぜひ！じゃあせめて、ここは僕たちにおごらせて！","source_cn":"好啊好啊！这顿我们请客！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79C6B29262FADF3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:赛琳":{"text":"セイリーン","source":"赛琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:利奥":{"text":"リオル","source":"利奥","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雷蒙德":{"text":"レイモンド","source":"雷蒙德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:吉罗德":{"text":"ジロード","source":"吉罗德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":4}}